{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t國家主席習近平在深圳前海國際會議中心出席亞太經合組織工商領導人峰會開幕式，並發表主指演講。<br/>\n<br/>\n開幕式前，習近平同與會亞太工商界代表集體合影。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：方潤南\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T02:24:22.453981+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":79,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T01:59:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T07:00:53.478183+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T02:17:32.713492+00:00","content_hash":"58a7d7a7a986b527a323faa6ee5e46b60ab8b19e48c89d7e58454189ef191d5a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}